-- Vena Mega -- Car Dealership Tycoon (place 1554960397), all-new functional MEGA build
-- Not a deobfuscation: every function below is written fresh for this game.
-- Beats the keyed ScriptBlox hubs at their own game, with no key: physical
-- Design notes (why the old autofarm broke):
--   The old Miles Grinder built a CLIENT-SIDED sky road and PivotTo-glided the
--   car along it every heartbeat. Client parts have no collision on the server
--   (FilteringEnabled), so the server saw the car fall / rubber-banded it back
--   and the glide fought physics at 60Hz. This build uses ZERO client parts and
--   ZERO position teleports for driving: it faces the car with rotation-only
--   snaps and holds real throttle, so the server sees legitimate driving.
-- The one thing that worked (teleport collect on foot) is kept, rewritten clean.

